2026-07-27T12:04:21.9780227Z i /tmp/Rtmpsy7AAg/duckdb
2026-07-27T12:04:21.9780621Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T12:04:21.9781084Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T12:04:21.9781490Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T12:04:21.9782117Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T12:04:21.9783046Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T12:04:21.9784177Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
